.. Shared Codex CLI setup for agentic authoring workflows.

Install the Codex CLI on the host using the official
`installation guide <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/codex/cli#install-codex>`_,
then `authenticate <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/auth>`_ on the host with ``codex login``.
Codex CLI 0.160.0 or newer is recommended, check with ``codex --version``.
